WEBVTT

1
00:01:33.291 --> 00:01:35.250
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna

2
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:40.416
began describing His divine vibhutis in detail.

3
00:01:40.416 --> 00:01:43.750
Now in these five verses of the tenth chapter,

4
00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:46.583
He reveals Himself in the most extraordinary

5
00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:49.000
manifestations across different categories

6
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.458
of existence.

7
00:01:51.458 --> 00:01:54.833
These examples give not only Arjun, but

8
00:01:54.833 --> 00:01:58.000
all seekers, a divine vision

9
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.250
that connects the visible

10
00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.208
with the invisible.

11
00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:08.125
In verse 10.29

12
00:02:08.125 --> 00:02:09.958
of chapter ten,

13
00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:13.375
Lord Krishna begins describing
His vibhutis among beings

14
00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:17.083
associated with power and mystery.

15
00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:21.000
Among the many-hooded serpents,
He is Ananta Shesha,

16
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.666
whose countless hoods form
the foundation of the universe.

17
00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:27.375
A symbol of infinite power.

18
00:02:27.375 --> 00:02:30.000
Among aquatic beings, Lord Krishna is Varuna,

19
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.125
the lord of the oceans, and the very embodiment

20
00:02:33.125 --> 00:02:36.750
of vastness and abundance.

21
00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:39.375
Among the ancestors, He is Aryama.

22
00:02:39.375 --> 00:02:42.500
The great ruler of Pitriloka,

23
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.458
as the upholder of cosmic justice,

24
00:02:44.458 --> 00:02:47.541
Lord Krishna is Yama,

25
00:02:47.541 --> 00:02:51.500
who ensures balance and accountability.

26
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.375
In the third verse, He explains
that among the Daityas,

27
00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:55.958
the descendants of Diti

28
00:02:55.958 --> 00:02:58.458
and demonic by nature,

29
00:02:58.458 --> 00:02:59.916
among those Daityas

30
00:02:59.916 --> 00:03:02.625
Lord Krishna is Prahlad,

31
00:03:02.625 --> 00:03:05.250
who, struggling with his circumstances,

32
00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.000
showed unwavering devotion to Vishnu.

33
00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.875
Prahlad's spiritual strength and courage

34
00:03:10.875 --> 00:03:13.291
reveal Lord Krishna's own power.

35
00:03:13.291 --> 00:03:14.541
Through this power of devotion,

36
00:03:14.541 --> 00:03:16.750
he overcomes the obstacles

37
00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.708
of every kind of circumstance.

38
00:03:19.708 --> 00:03:21.625
Lord Krishna is Himself Kala.

39
00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:24.458
Kala means time,

40
00:03:24.458 --> 00:03:28.583
under which all are, and which controls all.

41
00:03:28.583 --> 00:03:31.916
Time is the symbol of Lord Krishna's

42
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:34.916
unimpeded influence over all of creation.

43
00:03:34.916 --> 00:03:37.083
Among animals, He is the lion.

44
00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:41.583
Mrigendra, the living embodiment
of glory and strength.

45
00:03:41.583 --> 00:03:44.166
Among birds, Lord Krishna is Garuda.

46
00:03:44.166 --> 00:03:46.708
The mighty carrier of Vishnu,

47
00:03:46.708 --> 00:03:50.083
a wonderful union of devotion and power.

48
00:03:50.083 --> 00:03:51.500
In verse 10.31,

49
00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.125
He highlights the powers

50
00:03:53.125 --> 00:03:55.166
of purification.

51
00:03:55.166 --> 00:03:57.958
Among purifiers, Lord Krishna is the wind,

52
00:03:57.958 --> 00:04:00.125
which removes impurities

53
00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:02.416
and nourishes life.

54
00:04:02.416 --> 00:04:05.583
Among weapon-bearers, He is Parashurama.

55
00:04:05.583 --> 00:04:09.000
A witness to divine justice and power.

56
00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:13.166
Among aquatic creatures, Lord Krishna
is the Makara – the crocodile,

57
00:04:13.166 --> 00:04:15.458
master of speed,

58
00:04:15.458 --> 00:04:18.625
strength, and dominance in the waters.

59
00:04:18.625 --> 00:04:21.500
Among rivers, He is the sacred Ganga.

60
00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:24.291
Jahnavi, flowing from His feet,

61
00:04:24.291 --> 00:04:27.500
purifying all.

62
00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:28.500
In verse 10.32,

63
00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:29.500
Lord Krishna

64
00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:32.333
presents a broader view

65
00:04:32.333 --> 00:04:34.333
that goes beyond the material

66
00:04:34.333 --> 00:04:36.833
and looks at the level of consciousness.

67
00:04:36.833 --> 00:04:39.500
He declares Himself the beginning,

68
00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.500
middle, and end of all creation.

69
00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:45.000
This statement highlights His presence

70
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:48.000
at every stage of existence.

71
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.000
Among forms of knowledge, Lord Krishna

72
00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.583
is adhyatma-vidya, the
spiritual science of the self.

73
00:04:52.583 --> 00:04:54.541
Adhyatma-vidya,

74
00:04:54.541 --> 00:04:57.708
which addresses the highest purpose of life,

75
00:04:57.708 --> 00:05:01.250
that is, moksha and self-realisation.

76
00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:05.875
This science is superior to all material knowledge.

77
00:05:05.875 --> 00:05:09.625
Among forms of debate and
discussion, Lord Krishna is vada.

78
00:05:09.625 --> 00:05:13.041
The discussion that traces truth to its depth.

79
00:05:13.041 --> 00:05:15.708
Unlike contentious argument,

80
00:05:15.708 --> 00:05:20.125
the purpose of vada is to understand reality.

81
00:05:20.125 --> 00:05:21.875
In verse 10.33,

82
00:05:21.875 --> 00:05:23.041
among letters, Lord Krishna

83
00:05:23.041 --> 00:05:25.791
identifies Himself with the letter 'A',

84
00:05:25.791 --> 00:05:28.375
which is the foundation of all sounds

85
00:05:28.375 --> 00:05:31.458
and the first letter of the Sanskrit alphabet.

86
00:05:31.458 --> 00:05:33.250
It is the very first sound

87
00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:35.750
from which all words arise.

88
00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:38.541
Among compound words, Lord Krishna
is the dvandva compound, 

89
00:05:38.541 --> 00:05:40.291
such as Rama and Krishna.

90
00:05:40.291 --> 00:05:40.958
Where both

91
00:05:40.958 --> 00:05:43.875
elements are equally important.

92
00:05:43.875 --> 00:05:45.833
This symmetry and balance

93
00:05:45.833 --> 00:05:49.208
reflect Lord Krishna's wholeness.

94
00:05:49.208 --> 00:05:50.000
Lord Krishna

95
00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.916
specifically speaks of His
presence as akshaya kala.

96
00:05:53.916 --> 00:05:57.208
Inexhaustible, ever-abiding time,

97
00:05:57.208 --> 00:06:00.583
which governs all existence.

98
00:06:00.583 --> 00:06:03.833
Though time itself never ends,

99
00:06:03.833 --> 00:06:04.750
it brings great

100
00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:07.375
change in everything else.

101
00:06:07.375 --> 00:06:08.416
Being time itself

102
00:06:08.416 --> 00:06:12.750
speaks to Lord Krishna's eternal nature.

103
00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:16.708
Finally, among creators,
Lord Krishna is Brahma – 

104
00:06:16.708 --> 00:06:19.833
Dhata, The secondary creator,

105
00:06:19.833 --> 00:06:23.041
who, using Lord Krishna's own power,

106
00:06:23.041 --> 00:06:25.416
builds the universe.

107
00:06:25.416 --> 00:06:26.958
Brahma's creative

108
00:06:26.958 --> 00:06:29.375
ability too is a reflection

109
00:06:29.375 --> 00:06:32.666
of Lord Krishna's creative vibhuti.

110
00:06:32.666 --> 00:06:35.333
These verses ask us to see Lord Krishna

111
00:06:35.333 --> 00:06:39.166
not just in grand and awe-inspiring forms,

112
00:06:39.166 --> 00:06:41.916
but also in everyday

113
00:06:41.916 --> 00:06:44.833
manifestations.

114
00:06:44.833 --> 00:06:46.458
With this vision,

115
00:06:46.458 --> 00:06:49.000
we can transform the ordinary daily work of life

116
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.958
into opportunities for spiritual growth,

117
00:06:51.958 --> 00:06:55.458
and always remember His divine nature.

118
00:07:00.083 --> 00:07:02.333
Do you believe

119
00:07:02.333 --> 00:07:07.541
that your past determines your future?

120
00:07:07.541 --> 00:07:08.333
Suppose

121
00:07:08.333 --> 00:07:11.541
you once failed an exam

122
00:07:11.541 --> 00:07:14.750
or made a mistake.

123
00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:18.916
Does that memory still trouble you today?

124
00:07:18.916 --> 00:07:21.708
And you wonder,

125
00:07:21.708 --> 00:07:23.750
how do I move forward?

126
00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.750
Look at Prahlad,

127
00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:30.541
He was born into a family of demons,

128
00:07:30.541 --> 00:07:32.375
yet he became

129
00:07:32.375 --> 00:07:36.000
My greatest devotee.

130
00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.875
His circumstances did not stop him.

131
00:07:39.875 --> 00:07:46.416
His devotion and actions lifted him higher.

132
00:07:46.416 --> 00:07:49.458
Your truth is the same.

133
00:07:49.458 --> 00:07:54.625
What your past was does not matter.

134
00:07:54.625 --> 00:07:57.500
What your future will be,

135
00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:01.833
that matters.

136
00:08:01.833 --> 00:08:06.500
Your mistakes do not define you.

137
00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:10.500
Your actions today define you.

138
00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:15.500
Do not let your past weigh you down.

139
00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:19.833
Do not consider yourself unworthy,

140
00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:22.500
but instead focus on

141
00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:26.291
what you can do now.

142
00:08:26.291 --> 00:08:30.000
To move forward, to improve,

143
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.416
to connect with your higher purpose.

144
00:08:33.416 --> 00:08:36.000
When you walk with truth, compassion,

145
00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.708
and devotion,

146
00:08:38.708 --> 00:08:42.875
you move toward a brighter destination.

147
00:08:42.875 --> 00:08:47.416
Your journey is shaped by
the choices you make today.

148
00:08:47.416 --> 00:08:50.791
When you set the right goal with a sincere heart

149
00:08:50.791 --> 00:08:54.083
and act with integrity,

150
00:08:54.083 --> 00:08:56.125
no obstacle

151
00:08:56.125 --> 00:09:01.250
can stop you from reaching Me.

152
00:09:05.791 --> 00:09:09.500
In a family, differences are natural,

153
00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:12.416
but how you handle them,

154
00:09:12.416 --> 00:09:15.875
that determines the peace of your home.

155
00:09:15.875 --> 00:09:19.166
Now imagine, during the evening meal,

156
00:09:19.166 --> 00:09:22.250
a disagreement arises over something.

157
00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:24.625
What will you do? 

158
00:09:24.625 --> 00:09:26.916
Will you raise your voice

159
00:09:26.916 --> 00:09:30.958
to have your way, or to find the truth

160
00:09:30.958 --> 00:09:34.208
will you listen quietly? I

161
00:09:34.208 --> 00:09:37.500
represent vada.

162
00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:42.833
The search for truth, not an ego-filled quarrel.

163
00:09:42.833 --> 00:09:45.458
When there is disagreement, do not ask,

164
00:09:45.458 --> 00:09:47.916
'Who was right?'

165
00:09:47.916 --> 00:09:50.666
Ask, 'What is right?'

166
00:09:50.666 --> 00:09:52.916
This shift is very important.

167
00:09:52.916 --> 00:09:55.625
Moving out of dispute
means moving from quarrel

168
00:09:55.625 --> 00:09:58.708
toward constructive conversation.

169
00:09:58.708 --> 00:10:00.458
It transforms this struggle

170
00:10:00.458 --> 00:10:03.166
into an opportunity for
understanding and growth.

171
00:10:03.166 --> 00:10:05.666
When your family practises vada,

172
00:10:05.666 --> 00:10:08.750
it means listening with respect,

173
00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:13.583
speaking with honesty, and
seeking a solution good for all.

174
00:10:13.583 --> 00:10:18.000
Arguments driven by ego and self-assertion

175
00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:20.625
only divide the family,

176
00:10:20.625 --> 00:10:24.333
but conversation in search of truth

177
00:10:24.333 --> 00:10:26.875
strengthens relationships.

178
00:10:26.875 --> 00:10:28.250
Remember,

179
00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:32.000
the goal of family is not to defeat each other,

180
00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.958
but to stand by each other.

181
00:10:34.958 --> 00:10:37.583
When you set aside pride and give priority

182
00:10:37.583 --> 00:10:41.750
to truth and understanding, then you

183
00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:45.041
invite Me into your home,

184
00:10:45.041 --> 00:10:49.291
and I come bringing peace and unity.

185
00:10:54.083 --> 00:10:56.416
Tomorrow morning, going to the office,

186
00:10:56.416 --> 00:10:59.291
someone worries in their mind,

187
00:10:59.291 --> 00:11:02.291
'What will my future hold?

188
00:11:02.291 --> 00:11:05.250
Will I get a promotion or not?

189
00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:08.416
Will the job last or will it go?'

190
00:11:08.416 --> 00:11:10.166
Then listen.

191
00:11:10.166 --> 00:11:12.625
Amid such worries,

192
00:11:12.625 --> 00:11:16.916
I tell you about the power of Kala –

193
00:11:16.916 --> 00:11:19.166
Time

194
00:11:19.166 --> 00:11:21.208
is a great power.

195
00:11:21.208 --> 00:11:23.875
It affects everyone

196
00:11:23.875 --> 00:11:26.291
and spares no one,

197
00:11:26.291 --> 00:11:30.625
no matter how powerful or
wealthy someone may be.

198
00:11:30.625 --> 00:11:33.541
This truth should not discourage you,

199
00:11:33.541 --> 00:11:36.125
but should teach you humility

200
00:11:36.125 --> 00:11:40.791
and help you understand
the value of the present.

201
00:11:40.791 --> 00:11:43.375
In your professional life,

202
00:11:43.375 --> 00:11:46.291
do not waste your precious time

203
00:11:46.291 --> 00:11:49.458
worrying about the future.

204
00:11:49.458 --> 00:11:50.875
Instead,

205
00:11:50.875 --> 00:11:53.500
make good use of the present.

206
00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:56.833
Put your whole mind into your work.

207
00:11:56.833 --> 00:12:00.541
Learn as much as you can.

208
00:12:00.541 --> 00:12:03.583
Build meaningful relationships.

209
00:12:03.583 --> 00:12:06.208
When you respect time

210
00:12:06.208 --> 00:12:09.583
and use it wisely,

211
00:12:09.583 --> 00:12:11.375
then it rewards you with growth

212
00:12:11.375 --> 00:12:14.000
and fulfilment.

213
00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:18.625
At the same time, remembering
the supreme power of time

214
00:12:18.625 --> 00:12:21.291
keeps you humble.

215
00:12:21.291 --> 00:12:25.041
It always reminds you that position, successes,

216
00:12:25.041 --> 00:12:29.458
and wealth – all are temporary.

217
00:12:29.458 --> 00:12:32.250
What is truly lasting

218
00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:36.791
is your actions and your integrity.
